-- Record fields under `--release`'s renaming (backend.md §9, *Item 4,
-- taken up*), the same lines from both builds: a row-polymorphic accessor
-- over two record types of another module that share only the field it
-- reads; one field name on unrelated records; a record update through an
-- extensible row; a record pattern, a record alias constructor and its
-- pattern; derived `==` and `compare` on a record whose source-text field
-- order differs from its short-spelling order, asserted through
-- `List.sort` and a `Dict` keyed by it; a field holding a function; fields
-- spelled `a` and `b` beside a tuple's `a` and `b`; and more distinct field
-- names than one character can spell.
import Dict
import Node
import Shapes exposing (Disc, Pair, Rect)


